<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold Flight</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: none (no guild teaches it)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold flight &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast hold flight</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>With a swift move of the left hand the caster sends a small jolt at 
someone who is fighting, and a yellow aura settles around them. While the 
aura lasts, every time they try to flee, a strange power holds them back. 
It lasts until they stop fighting; then the aura fades.
</p><p>It only works on someone in a fight, and not on yourself. The target 
resists with their mind, and the spell may fail. It isn't an attack, so it 
starts no fight of its own. No guild teaches it, but it turns up on 
scrolls among random treasure.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Fleeing</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>